The site adapters in core/src/main/kotlin/pocketfare/core/sites/ are Kotlin ports
of FanFicFare's Python adapters:
  - XenForo2Adapter.kt   <- fanficfare/adapters/base_xenforo2forum_adapter.py
                            and the per-site adapter_forums*.py /
                            adapter_alternatehistorycom.py subclasses
  - RoyalRoadAdapter.kt  <- fanficfare/adapters/adapter_royalroadcom.py
The ports have been modified (rewritten in Kotlin, simplified, and adapted to
this application's architecture).

Third-party libraries (all Apache License 2.0 unless noted):
  - jsoup (MIT License)
  - OkHttp
  - AndroidX / Jetpack Compose
  - Kotlin standard library and kotlinx.coroutines
  - JSON-java (org.json, Public Domain), JVM command-line build only
